      "system": {
        "description": "<p><span class=\"fontstyle0\">The mongrel dog is quick to action when it senses prey. When the&nbsp;&nbsp;mongrel dog&nbsp;enters a scene, immediately generate 1 Action Point. If the&nbsp;&nbsp;mongrel dog&nbsp;is an ally, then this goes into the group pool. If it is an enemy, it goes into the GM&rsquo;s pool.</span></p>",
